From b2168b4227b9061fe11ba9e50a7d02519779dffb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arnaud Pouliquen <arnaud.pouliquen@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Aug 2024 13:24:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 589/913] dts: stm32: update mlahb dma range for the stm32mp15
 series.

The  MCU SRAMs base address 0x10000000, the address 0x30000000
is an alias.
The firewall only supports the 0x10000000 base address for the ETZPC
memory protection.
update the mlahb dma-range to transform Cortex-M address to this bus
address.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git af0dcf08cafc52f5d029eb0b9bbad4507e46a084 dts: stm32: update mlahb dma range for the stm32mp15 series.]
Signed-off-by: Arnaud Pouliquen <arnaud.pouliquen@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I07ccda71847e9e820880678488585de1a5449862
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/570901
Tested-by: Arnaud POULIQUEN <arnaud.pouliquen@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Arnaud POULIQUEN <arnaud.pouliquen@st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Olivier MOYSAN <olivier.moysan@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Arnaud POULIQUEN <arnaud.pouliquen@st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp151.dtsi | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp151.dtsi b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp151.dtsi
index 3adb21296..5d024f39f 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp151.dtsi
+++ b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp151.dtsi
@@ -2137,7 +2137,7 @@
 		ranges;
 		dma-ranges = <0x00000000 0x38000000 0x10000>,
 			     <0x10000000 0x10000000 0x60000>,
-			     <0x30000000 0x30000000 0x60000>;
+			     <0x30000000 0x10000000 0x60000>;
 
 		m4_rproc: m4@10000000 {
 			compatible = "st,stm32mp1-m4";
